<title>NETHERLANDS: Rhine corridor refiners resist pressure to cut run.</title>
<headline>Rhine corridor refiners resist pressure to cut run.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Refineries in Benelux and along the Rhine in Germany have resisted the pressure to cut runs as margins have deteriorated, but their resolve may wane if they continue to fall, traders and refiners themselves said this week.</p>
<p>&quot;We see margins are quite low. If they continue to drop, most probably we will cut,&quot; said a trader at one ARA refiner.</p>
